{
  "slug": "food-date-labels-and-sensory-checking",
  "capturedAt": "2026-06-01T15:21:52.681Z",
  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "The UK throws away around 9.5 million tonnes of food per year. The Food Standards Agency estimates that date label confusion accounts for around 250,000 tonnes of that total: food with a ",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "text": "best-before date",
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termId": "cmpv46oza0001z4v4mchigqh0"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": " discarded because a household handles it the same way as a ",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "text": "use-by date",
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termId": "cmpv46oyh0000z4v4masezqpr"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": ".",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "Foods with a use-by date (safety-relevant)",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "bulletList",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "text": "Fresh chilled meat: do not eat after use-by.",
                    "type": "text",
                    "marks": []
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "text": "Fresh fish and shellfish: do not eat after use-by.",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "text": "Some ready-made chilled meals and chilled dairy products.",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "Foods with a best-before date (quality-only)",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "bulletList",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "text": "Dried pasta, rice, lentils, and pulses: safe for 1 to 2 years past best-before if stored dry.",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "text": "Canned food: safe for years past best-before. If the can is undamaged and not swollen, the contents are safe.",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "text": "Flour, sugar, salt: no safety risk past best-before. The only change is quality. Flour loses some raising power over time; that is not a reason to throw it away.",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "text": "Hard cheese: surface mould can be cut off and the rest eaten. Not true for soft cheese, which should be discarded if mouldy.",
                    "type": "text",
                    "marks": []
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "text": "Bread: surface mould indicates it should be discarded. Stale bread without mould is safe and good for breadcrumbs, bread pudding, or toast.",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "The sensory check",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "For foods with a best-before date: look, smell, taste a small amount if the first two pass. Off flavours are detectable before harmful levels of most spoilage organisms are reached. This is not the same as use-by foods where pathogenic bacteria can be present at dangerous levels without detectable smell or taste change. Never use sensory checks as a substitute for the use-by date on safety-relevant products.",
            "type": "text",
            "marks": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "troubleshooter",
        "attrs": {
          "title": "Troubleshooter"
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "troubleshooterItem",
            "attrs": {
              "symptom": "Eggs: no date visible or past best before"
            },
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "text": "Float test: a fresh egg sinks horizontally. An egg that stands on one end is 1 to 2 weeks old but still safe. An egg that floats is stale and should be discarded. This works because the air cell enlarges as the egg ages.",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "Method",
            "type": "text",
            "marks": []
          }
        ]
      },
